
---
import "@fontsource/open-sans/400.css";
import "@fontsource/open-sans/600.css";
import "@fontsource/open-sans/700.css";
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta
      name="viewport"
      content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"
    />
    <title>Privacy Policy | Trustpoint</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Privacy information for the Trustpoint project website."
    />
    <link
      rel="icon"
      type="image/png"
      href="/logos/trustpoint_favicon.png"
    />
    <link
      rel="canonical"
      href="https://industrial-security.io/privacy"
    />
  </head>

  <body>
    <header>
      <div class="container navigation">
        <a href="/" aria-label="Trustpoint homepage">
          <img
            src="/logos/trustpoint_logo.svg"
            alt="Trustpoint"
            width="180"
          />
        </a>

        <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
          <a href="/">Home</a>
          <a href="/imprint">Imprint</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="legal-page">
        <div class="container">
          <p class="section-label">Legal information</p>

          <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

          <h2>1. Data controller</h2>
          <p>
            Proposed controller, subject to confirmation:
          </p>
          <p>
            Campus Schwarzwald gGmbH<br />
            Herzog-Eberhard-Straße 56<br />
            72250 Freudenstadt<br />
            Germany
          </p>
          <p>
            Email:
            <a href="mailto:info@campus-schwarzwald.de">
              info@campus-schwarzwald.de
            </a>
          </p>

          <h2>2. Hosting and server logs</h2>
          <p>
            This website is intended to be hosted
            using Netlify.
          </p>
          <p>
            When accessing a website, technical
            information such as IP addresses,
            requested resources, timestamps and
            browser information may be processed
            by the hosting infrastructure.
          </p>
          <p>
            Before publication, the final notice
            must identify the relevant hosting
            provider, processing purposes, legal
            basis, retention periods and any
            international data transfers.
          </p>

          <h2>3. External links</h2>
          <p>
            This website provides links to external
            websites, including GitHub, technical
            documentation, Campus Schwarzwald,
            Trustpoint Labs and research partners.
          </p>
          <p>
            When following an external link,
            the destination website's privacy
            practices apply.
          </p>

          <h2>4. Cookies and tracking</h2>
          <p>
            The new website is designed to use
            static pages without analytics or
            marketing integrations.
          </p>
          <p>
            Any actual cookies, tracking technologies
            and third-party resources must be
            verified before this section is finalized.
          </p>

          <h2>5. Your rights</h2>
          <p>
            Depending on the circumstances, you have
            rights under the GDPR, including access,
            rectification, erasure, restriction,
            portability and objection.
          </p>
          <p>
            Where processing is based on consent,
            you may withdraw that consent.
            You may also lodge a complaint with
            a competent data protection authority.
          </p>

          <h2>6. Contact</h2>
          <p>
            For privacy-related questions, contact:
            <a href="mailto:info@campus-schwarzwald.de">
              info@campus-schwarzwald.de
            </a>
          </p>

          <h2>7. Additional information</h2>
          <p>
            <a
              href="https://www.campus-schwarzwald.de/datenschutz/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              Campus Schwarzwald privacy information
            </a>
          </p>

          <p>
            <a href="/">Back to Trustpoint</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
